## 4. A concrete business handler (example)

```java
public record LoanRequestEvent(String requestId, Applicant applicant, BigDecimal amount) {
    public record Applicant(String nationalCode, String fullName) {}
}

@Component
@RequiredArgsConstructor
public class LoanRequestHandler implements TopicHandler<LoanRequestEvent> {

    private final ResilientApiClient api;

    @Override public String topic() { return "loan.requests"; }
    @Override public Class<LoanRequestEvent> payloadType() { return LoanRequestEvent.class; }

    @Override
    public String extractNationalCode(LoanRequestEvent p) {
        return p.applicant().nationalCode();   // nested here...
    }

    @Override
    public Mono<Void> onMatch(LoanRequestEvent p, String nationalCode) {
        return api.post("loan-api", "/loans/flag", Map.of("requestId", p.requestId(), "nationalCode", nationalCode));
    }
}
```

A second topic where the code lives at the top level and a *different* API is called:

